# LaTeX build artifacts -- regenerate with:
#   pdflatex main.tex && bibtex main && pdflatex main.tex && pdflatex main.tex
# main.pdf itself IS tracked (not ignored) so the compiled paper is visible
# without anyone needing a LaTeX install.
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bbl-SAVE-ERROR
*.blg
*.log
*.out
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
